   "sourceHash": "3aab7c9fb61fb9fec09d43d25f8520cc616dba8585af643d9a7878271268e91c",
   "text": "该项目适用于脊柱退行性病变、炎症性脊椎炎，还是两者皆可？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_496aa6c7c23f2702e6ba",
   "sourceHash": "496aa6c7c23f2702e6ba6a44ccd16e08bc3d29d7acc7a7b46d3cbdbdecee3dfb",
   "text": "请让团队根据您已确诊的诊断来匹配项目。颈椎病（脊椎关节病，spondylosis）与脊椎炎（spondylitis）是不同的病症，因此不应仅凭名称来做出选择。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
